{"id":"n93473-1-8","stage":5,"title":"우선순위 · 优先顺序","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93473-1-8-1","ko":"여보세요, 식당이지요? 예약을 하려고 하는데요.","zh":"喂，这里是餐厅对吧？我想预约座位。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보세요,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"여보세요：喂","readings":[{"term":"여보세요","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17866","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보세요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당이지요?","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예약을","meaning":"预约，预订","explanation":"예약：预约，预订；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예약","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70599","senseId":"1","lemma":"예약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는데요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9cbcfc6759228a23","term":"여보세요","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/9cbcfc6759228a233380.mp3","entryId":"17866","definition":"用于通话时招呼对方。","pronunciation":["여보세요"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"a04df23492bdcfa7","term":"예약","zh":"预约，预订","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3","entryId":"70599","definition":"为使用位置、房间、东西等而提前约好；或指那样的约定。","pronunciation":["예ː약"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95f91432f63a4a98e99d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93473-1-8-2","ko":"저희는 예약을 받지 않고 일찍 오시는 손님을 우선순위로 모십니다.","zh":"我们不接受预约，优先接待提前到店的客人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희는","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"1","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예약을","meaning":"预约，预订","explanation":"예약：预约，预订；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예약","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70599","senseId":"1","lemma":"예약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받지","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오시는","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님을","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우선순위로","meaning":"优先顺序","explanation":"우선순위：优先顺序；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"우선순위","audio":"/audio/32ae423352d3ecfb0bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93473","senseId":"1","lemma":"우선순위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모십니다.","meaning":"陪同，随行，请","explanation":"모시다：陪同，随行，请；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"모시다","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64703","senseId":"2","lemma":"모시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"a04df23492bdcfa7","term":"예약","zh":"预约，预订","audio":"/audio/a04df23492bdcfa7ff7b.mp3","entryId":"70599","definition":"为使用位置、房间、东西等而提前约好；或指那样的约定。","pronunciation":["예ː약"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"32ae423352d3ecfb","term":"우선순위","zh":"优先顺序","audio":"/audio/32ae423352d3ecfb0bc1.mp3","entryId":"93473","definition":"首先占据或使用某个东西的次序或位置。","pronunciation":["우선수뉘"]},{"id":"64829bc709a905af","term":"모시다","zh":"陪同，随行，请","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3","entryId":"64703","definition":"(尊称)带领。","pronunciation":["모ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4af6210788ec436b626b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.305,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=93473","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们不接受预约，优先接待提前到店的客人。","喂，这里是餐厅对吧？我想预约座位。","那次相亲的男生怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["喂，这里是餐厅对吧？我想预约座位。","那次相亲的男生怎么样？","我们不接受预约，优先接待提前到店的客人。"],"answer":2}]}
